   "text": "Welcome to this session on Ohm's law."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.6,
   "end": 23.7,
   "text": "Voltage is proportional to current."
  },
  {
   "start": 23.95,
   "end": 26.55,
   "text": "We write this as V equals I R."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.7,
   "end": 28.1,
   "text": "Here is a resistor."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.25,
   "end": 30.25,
   "text": "So the current is two amperes."
  },
  {
   "start": 30.4,
   "end": 32.4,
   "text": "Let us fill in the step."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.7,
   "end": 35.1,
   "text": "Watch the current rise."
  },
  {
   "start": 35.25,
   "end": 36.65,
   "text": "And the voltage doubles."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.95,
   "end": 39.05,
